        "type": "card",
        "tag": "OFFICIAL · DRINKING WATER INSPECTORATE",
        "l1": "A TINY AMOUNT",
        "l2": "MUST REACH YOUR TAP",
        "source": "DWI"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "It keeps the water hygienic on its long journey through the pipes.",
      "gap": 0.3,
      "caps": [
