        "label": "DISINFECTANT"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "So how much is in there? Usually around half a milligram per litre, or less.",
      "gap": 0.3,
      "caps": [
        "HOW *MUCH?",
        "ABOUT *HALF",
        "A MILLIGRAM PER *LITRE"
      ],
      "scene": {
